{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "OA Corp Sales：40秒提醒器",
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "(corp-sales-40sec-alert) 在業務名單頁面提供每40秒定時提醒功能，以聲音警示並閃爍 FAB 按鈕，提示業務員切換下一筆名單。",
  "permissions": [
    "activeTab"
  ],
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://corp.orangeapple.co/marketing/sales*"
      ],
      "css": [
        "style.css"
      ],
      "js": [
        "content.js"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "icons": {
    "16": "icon16.png",
    "48": "icon48.png",
    "128": "icon128.png"
  }
}
